exports[`the built-in copy is what it was before wording became editable organization_domain_expiring, with a support address 1`] = `
{
  "html": 
"<!doctype html>
<html><body style="margin:0;padding:24px;font-family:-apple-system,Segoe UI,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a1a1a">
<p>A verified domain of Acme &lt;Robotics&gt; &amp; Sons on Acme will stop being trusted within 30 days.</p>
<p>After that, people with an address on the domain are no longer offered the organization or added to it automatically. Members who are already in it stay.</p>
<p>To keep it, open the organization&#39;s domain settings and verify the domain again with a new code. This takes a minute and starts another year.</p>
<p>If it wasn&#39;t you who set the domain up, or you no longer use it, you can ignore this email and let it lapse.</p>
<p style="margin-top:32px;font-size:13px;color:#666">Acme<br>Need help? Contact help@acme.test</p>
</body></html>"
,
  "subject": "Domain verification for Acme <Robotics> & Sons on Acme ends soon",
  "text": 
"A verified domain of Acme <Robotics> & Sons on Acme will stop being trusted within 30 days.

After that, people with an address on the domain are no longer offered the organization or added to it automatically. Members who are already in it stay.

To keep it, open the organization's domain settings and verify the domain again with a new code. This takes a minute and starts another year.

If it wasn't you who set the domain up, or you no longer use it, you can ignore this email and let it lapse.

--
Acme
Need help? Contact help@acme.test"
,
}
`;

